    {
      "description": "Automerge pkgrel-only apk pin bumps (the apk datasource's versioning classifies 1.22-r7 -> 1.22-r8 as patch): an Alpine rebuild of the same upstream release – the CLI is unchanged by definition, so no human review is needed (pkgver bumps are minor/major and stay manual via the next rule). Grouped into one branch (groupName): split packages built from one APKBUILD share pkgver and pkgrel and drift together, so per-package PRs would leave the sibling pin stale in each PR's own tree – the build's apk add cannot resolve it and the automerge deadlocks against the sibling PR; one grouped PR per upstream event carries every drifted pin and stays self-consistent. The changelog entry is added post-merge by the apk-bump workflow. automergeStrategy rebase: linear history without merge bubbles (conflicts block the automerge until resolved – same rationale as the supervisor-pin rule); applies on both merge paths (Renovate's own merge today – no branch protection, platformAutomerge: false – and platform-native automerge if branch protection ever arrives).",
